{"id":"00045","root":"uni00045_1","name":{"ja":"イングリッド","en":"Ingrid"},"title":{"ja":"【晴着美女】","en":"【Kimono Beauty】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【晴着美女】 イングリッド","en":"【Kimono Beauty】 Ingrid"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Nomad"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":10,"profile":{"ja":"エドウィン・ブラックの側近。エドウィン・ブラックの勢力に属する魔界の貴族階級の子弟出身。常に彼に従い護衛として、優秀な秘書として仕えている。魔界騎士の異名を持つ美女。得物は長剣。斬り裂いた敵を黒い炎で焼き尽くす魔剣術の使い手。エドウィン・ブラックには主従関係以上の思いを抱いているが、それは胸の奥に秘め、常に献身的。ただしエドウィン・ブラック以外には冷徹な風で接し、朧とは対立している。魔族と呼ばれる魔界では多数を占める種族で、人間と姿は似ているが身体能力は超人的で人間とは比較にならない戦闘能力を有す。彼らの種族の中で特に力を持つ者は人間の世界でも「悪魔」としてその名を書物に記されているものが多数存在する。年が明けたことにより周りの部下たちに晴れ着を着させられる。だがその姿はどこか花魁の臭いがする美麗女帝になってしまうのであった。","en":"Ingrid is a close aide of Edwin Black. She hails from the noble class of the Demon Realm that serves Edwin Black's faction. Always obeying him, she works as his bodyguard and an excellent secretary. She is a beautiful woman known by the epithet \"Demon Knight.\" Her weapon is a longsword, and she wields demonic swordsmanship that incinerates sliced foes with black flames. Although she harbors feelings for Edwin Black that go beyond master and servant, she keeps them hidden deep in her heart and remains devoted. However, she treats everyone other than Edwin Black with a cold, ruthless demeanor and is at odds with Oboro. In the Demon Realm, demons—who resemble humans in appearance but possess superhuman physical abilities and combat prowess far surpassing those of humans—make up the majority of the population. Among them, many are recorded in human texts as \"demons.\" With the new year, her subordinates have dressed her in formal attire, but the result is a stunning empress who exudes a faint aura of a courtesan."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"榊木春乃","forms":[{"id":"uni00045_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[824,1648],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[115,230],"def":[79,158],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":37,"skills":["4","109"]},{"id":"un